  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *estirado*",
    "*estirar algo* = to stretch/pull something (*Estira los brazos antes de correr* — Stretch your arms before running)",
    "*estirarse* (reflexive) = to stretch oneself, to stretch out (*Me estiro todas las mañanas* — I stretch every morning)",
    "*estirar las piernas* = to stretch one's legs (take a short walk)",
    "Related: *el estiramiento* = stretch, stretching; *estirado/a* = stretched; also colloquial for uptight/stiff"
  ],
